mutate(Model = c("ID Random Forest Accuracy", "ID Random Forest AUC", "OOD Concept Shift Worst Random Forest Accuracy", "OOD Concept Shift Worst Random Forest AUC", "OOD Concept Shift Better Random Forest Accuracy", "OOD Concept Shift Better Random Forest AUC"))
